{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>杜如風（Helen）在今晚第2集播出的《跟風旅行團》中，帶觀眾跟隨BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa的 …</p><p></p>\n<p>杜如風（Helen）在今晚第2集播出的《跟風旅行團》中，帶觀眾跟隨BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa的步伐，朝聖首爾弘大一間介紹片高達逾2,000萬點擊的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」！究竟這碗麵有何魔力？Helen更為一款人氣Gelato甘願排長龍，場面墟冚！\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e9%a6%96%e7%88%be%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a-3544234/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團第1集｜杜如風帶路首爾掃貨天堂！一文睇清4間熱店資料</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e4%bd%8f%e5%ae%bf-3544586/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜開箱600幾蚊入住雪嶽山森林渡假村！杜如風實測千元玻璃屋睇靚景</a></p>\n<h2>跟風旅行團第2集｜直擊弘大2,000萬View打卡熱點 杜如風實試Jisoo同款三文魚麵</h2>\n<p>今集杜如風跟隨網紅影片，來到位於弘大的「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」Mippeudong朝聖。據報這間餐廳的介紹影片在網上點擊數高達逾2,000萬，連人氣女團BLACKPINK成員Jisoo及Lisa也是常客，人氣極高！餐廳的特色是以新鮮三文魚製成「刺身」麵條，名副其實啖啖肉。杜如風在節目中先後試食了「番茄三文魚麵」、「雪蟹味噌套餐」及「豪華蓋飯」，而且款款價值均十分相宜，絕對是粉絲必到的打卡點。\n</p>\n<h3>Mippeudong三文魚麵餐廳<br/>\n地址 首爾市麻浦區延南洞384-7<br/>\n營業時間：每日 11:00 – 22:30</h3>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_292788416afbe2b7896be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」Mippeudong（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_292788416afbe2b7896be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>「超足料三文魚麵餐廳」Mippeudong（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>為食甘願排長龍 杜如風激讚杜拜朱古力麻糬Gelato</h2>\n<p>除了三文魚麵，杜如風亦到訪一間「超人氣排隊Gelato店」。為了品嚐店內名物「杜拜朱古力開心果麻糬Gelato」，她竟然也願意加入長長人龍排隊等食。這款Gelato據說能一啖集齊香、脆、煙韌三重豐富口感，令杜如風食完後也讚不絕口，大讚期待值爆燈，可見其魅力非凡。</p>\n<h3>MAMAN GELATO 網紅Gelato店<br/>\n地址：首爾市城東區聖水洞二街315-18<br/>\n營業時間：每日 11:30 – 21:00</h3>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1766554203_3794454131894204006_59092546936_20555734516afc59c95283f-1024x1024.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：maman_gelato）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1766554203_3794454131894204006_59092546936_20555734516afc59c95283f-1024x1024.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：maman_gelato）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1740813337_3578524097082310684_59092546936_21356489116afc59c78e301-1024x768.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：maman_gelato）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/maman_gelato_1740813337_3578524097082310684_59092546936_21356489116afc59c78e301-1024x768.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：maman_gelato）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民瘋狂洗版：跟住BLACKPINK去食！</h2>\n<p>節目介紹的美食清單引發網民熱烈討論，不少人都表示要跟隨杜如風的腳步去朝聖。網民紛紛留言：「嘩！連Jisoo同Lisa都係常客，呢間一定要去！」、「三文魚變做麵條？好想知咩味！」、「個Gelato聽個名都覺得好正好邪惡！」、「多謝Helen介紹，下次去首爾有新目標！」、「睇見都流口水，今晚即刻想食三文魚！」</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1021499946afbe2b39b2ff.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_1021499946afbe2b39b2ff.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）<a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11211093436afbe2bf94426.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_11211093436afbe2bf94426.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8054572666afbe2bb8600b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_8054572666afbe2bb8600b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11261816726afbe2ae5d366.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_11261816726afbe2ae5d366.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a>\n</p>\n<h2>2025年新開！雪嶽山無敵靚景住宿玻璃屋頂樹屋露台</h2>\n<p>想用親民價錢享受豪華住宿？杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，就為大家開箱位於雪嶽山的森林渡假村！這裡的住宿不但有玻璃屋頂設計，可以躺在床上看風景，價錢更僅需500多到1,000零元港幣，CP值極高，究竟有幾正？詳情請看這裡：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98-%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8-%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e4%bd%8f%e5%ae%bf-3544586/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團｜開箱600幾蚊入住雪嶽山森林渡假村！杜如風實測千元玻璃屋睇靚景</a></p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2></h2>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb%e5%8d%b3%e6%99%82%e8%b3%87%e8%a8%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb即時資訊</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%9c%e5%a6%82%e9%a2%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">杜如風</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%b7%9f%e9%a2%a8%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c%e5%9c%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">跟風旅行團</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e7%be%8e%e9%a3%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">韓國美食</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544583\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:55:32.646809+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1608,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:48:58.954324+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:48:58.954324+00:00","content_hash":"4bff27730317e13d07d435da42ed346c24cbb30fd5aabfe2103d365d37400842","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}